  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><placeName ref="namedentities.xml#lyceum"><hi rend="allcaps">Theatre Royal, Lyceum</hi></placeName><lb/>
               Under the Authority of Lord Chamberlain.<lb/>
               This present <hi rend="allcaps">Wednesday, <date when="1811-01-23">January 23, 1811</date></hi>.<lb/>
               Their Majesties Servants will Act the Comedy of<lb/>
               <bibl><title type="main" ref="namedentities.xml#play_man_and_wife">Man &amp; Wife;</title><lb/>
               <title type="sub"><hi rend="italic"><hi rend="allcaps">Or, More Secrets Than One</hi></hi></title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Lord Austencourt,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ho"><hi rend="allcaps">Mr. Holland</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Sir Rowland Austencourt,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_po">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Powell</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Charles Austencourt,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#be_wr">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Wrench</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Sir Willoughby Worrett,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_do">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Dowton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Abet Grouse,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ri_wr">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Wroughton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mr. Cornelius O'Dedimus,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_he_jo">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Johnstone</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Ponder,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ma">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mathews</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Sailor,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ge_sm">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Countryman,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_knight">Mr. <hi rend="mallcaps">Knight</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Game-Keeper,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wa_ma">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Maddocks</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Parish Officer,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#gh_sp">Mr. Sparks</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>William,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#al_we">Mr. Webb,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Servant,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_evans">Mr. Evans.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lady Worrett,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_ha">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Harlowe</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Ellen Worrett,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#el_ed">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Edwin</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Fanny,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Poole</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Tiffany,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#an_sc">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Scott</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               After which (<hi rend="italic">4th Time</hi>) a <hi rend="italic">New Musical Farce</hi>, called<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="play_bee_hive">The Bee Hive.</title></bibl><lb/>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Overture</hi> and <hi rend="allcaps">Music</hi> entirely New,<lb/>
               Composed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ed_ho">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Horn</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head><hi rend="italic">The Characters by</hi></head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ma">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mathews</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#be_wr">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Wrench</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_lo">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lovegrove</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_ch">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Chatterley</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_mo">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Mountain</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Kelly</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ti">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Tidswell</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               Boxes and Places to be taken of Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Spring</hi>, at the Box Office in the<lb/>
               Strand Entrances, of whom may also be had <hi rend="allcaps">Private Boxes</hi> Nightly.<lb/>
               Boxes <measure type="currency">6s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. Pit <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. <measure type="currency">6d</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. Gallery <measure type="currency">2s</measure>.<lb/>
               Second Price <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Upper Gallery <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">6d</measure>.<lb/>
               The Doors to be opened at <time when="17:30:00">Half past Five</time>, and the Performance to begin at <time when="18:30:00">half past Six</time>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">Vivant Rex et Regina!-No Money to be returned.</hi><lb/>
               The New Music Farce of The <hi rend="allcaps">Bee Hive</hi>, performed (for the 3rd Time)<lb/>
               last night, was received by a crowded and brilliant audience with<lb/>
               universal approbation and reiterated bursts of applause, from every part of<lb/>
               the Theatre, and will be repeated every evening till further notice.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
